nto the governance commit on either unborn or existing `HEAD` repositories, and surfaces a 1-line `worktrees/\u003crepo\u003e-\u003ctask\u003e` orientation note in `printInitializationSummary`.\n- Embeds POSIX `$PATH` fallback resolution (`$GOBIN`, `$HOME/go/bin`, `$HOME/.local/bin`, `$HOME/bin`) with graceful `{}` fallback when `nomos` is absent across `DefaultClaudeSettingsHooksJSON`, `DefaultGeminiSettingsHooksJSON`, `nomos.ts.tmpl`, and `PreCommitHookScript` / `PrePushHookScript`, plus actionable coding-agent and `git stash \u0026\u0026 nomos task chore` instructions when direct commits hit a protected trunk branch.\n","sha256_receipt":"ffe01764f4b6d084d00bab48d69d847b3b30648b5d8059b3d75a60ea02c3c15d"}
